  "post_content": "<p>La Asociaci&oacute;n Musical Talense ofreci&oacute; anoche en el Edificio Multifuncional un extraordinario concierto en conmemoraci&oacute;n del XXII aniversario de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Jubilados y Pensionistas &quot;Mont&iacute;&quot;, compuesto fundamentalmente por pasodobles.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/05/IMG_7587.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La actuaci&oacute;n de la banda de m&uacute;sica se inici&oacute; con el pasodoble Tales, compuesto por su director, Jos&eacute; Francisco Marco Ramos. Despu&eacute;s vino Amades Alabau, de Jaime Teixidor, Banderas moradas, El gran Roca, y Pedr&iacute;n Moreno, tres pasodobles de Mart&iacute;n Alonso. Tras The bombastic bombardon, de Edrich Siegert, otro pasodoble, Las Provincias, de V.A. Terol, para finalizar con Abba Gold, arreglo de Ron Sebregts sobre canciones del cuarteto vocal sueco.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7581.jpg\" alt=\"img_7581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7582.jpg\" alt=\"img_7582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7583.jpg\" alt=\"img_7583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7584.jpg\" alt=\"img_7584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7585.jpg\" alt=\"img_7585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7586.jpg\" alt=\"img_7586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7587.jpg\" alt=\"img_7587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7588.jpg\" alt=\"img_7588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7589.jpg\" alt=\"img_7589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7590.jpg\" alt=\"img_7590\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7591.jpg\" alt=\"img_7591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7592.jpg\" alt=\"img_7592\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7593.jpg\" alt=\"img_7593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7594.jpg\" alt=\"img_7594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7595.jpg\" alt=\"img_7595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7596.jpg\" alt=\"img_7596\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7597.jpg\" alt=\"img_7597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttalenseassocpensionistes/img_7598.jpg\" alt=\"img_7